{"parse": {"title": "GLN-00", "pageid": 124982, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">GLN-00</span><a href=\"/wiki/GLN-01\" title=\"GLN-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">GLN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">00</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.90.A5.E5.9C.B0.E6.83.8A.E9.AD.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"营地惊魂\">营地惊魂</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 营地惊魂</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻的男性：</div><div>哦——看来入口就是这儿了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冒失的男性：</div><div>绿湖营地——我们到，呃，绿湖，呕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迈克尔，显而易见的蠢货。他以伴生动物的方式生活，跟在更受欢迎的男性身后耍宝逗乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把自己变成了一只呱呱直叫的敲锣小猴，脑子里充满垃圾食品、酒精和迷幻魔药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">健壮的男性：</div><div>绿湖营地，我希望这儿真有一个又绿又深的湖，我们可以在里头游泳。穿泳衣，或不穿泳衣都行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">健壮的男性：</div><div>瞧瞧这结实的肌肉！我会让所有姑娘为此尖叫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弗莱迪，运动员。橄榄球校队队长。招摇，自我主义，近乎恼人的自恋者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段时日会是他人生中最为熠熠生辉的一章，等到十数年后，他会像酒鬼舔舐盐粒一般饥渴地回味这段青春。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻的男性：</div><div>该死，弗莱迪，穿好你的裤子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰森，年轻的学者，老师们最喜欢的那种学生。成绩优异，聪明、可靠而理性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比起大部分傻瓜男人都尊重女孩儿。兴趣是读百科全书，或是其他什么稀奇古怪的科学玩意儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>迈克尔，用这个擦擦脸吧，我们马上就能到营地了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安妮，这个疯狂年代中难得的贞洁淑女，拥有着恰当的美丽与温柔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她来自一个虔诚的教徒家庭，家中还有姊妹，每个周末都会参加社区举办的读书分享会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金发的女性：</div><div>……小声点，别吵了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金发的女性：</div><div>我还在宿醉，别触我的霉头，我们每个人都开心。懂了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿，标准的“金发姑娘”，愚蠢而大胆的那种，沉迷酒精、美丽的衣服和空虚的快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她好运地降生在富裕家庭，有一对百依百顺的父母。人们对她的称呼无外乎是甜心与宝贝——仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>现在——我们得去……篝火营地？对吗？带路的人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我先说好，伊莱舅舅给了我们这个营地的使用权，但他说这儿有点破旧……所以，你们懂的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>打扫好屋子，把最好的那间留给我，其余的你们随便分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>迈克尔会为你效劳的，甜心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>带上安妮吧，她是个女孩儿，做事会更细心一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总有一天，她会为自己的所作所为付出代价的，总有一天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的人们穿越森林，前往篝火营地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们坐下来，生篝火，讲故事，像大部分人一样享受露营的乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>所有人都死了，他们的头被悬挂在树顶，直到一周后，有新的露营者来到这里，一切才被发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>凶手？不，没有凶手，没有人见过凶手，他们说他早就失去了人性，他是恶魔附体不老而不死的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>迈克尔，你这个蠢货，别说那种蠢故事了！过来看着篝火！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>可是，故事还没结……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>不，呃，我是说，好的！我现在就来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>……嘿，你们有闻到吗？这儿有一股怪味儿，有点像是腐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的笑容僵在脸上，紧接着，晕车所致的呕吐感卷土重来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-610201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>我*！这他*是什么——！天啊，我是，看见它的内脏了？呃，呃——呕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>**！见鬼！别往我这儿吐，迈克尔你这个狗屎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰森：</div><div>让开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰森：</div><div>这是只獾，从腐烂程度来看，至少死了一周了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰森：</div><div>金蜜儿，你叔叔有没有说过这的森林里有野兽或——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰森：</div><div>金蜜儿？金……天呐，他们又溜走了？在这种时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-610401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>嗯……我想是的。当迈克尔开始呕吐的时候，弗莱迪就带着她离开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离群而去的年轻人们躲在树后相互拥抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>哦，哈哈……你真调皮！别这样了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-610101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>是吗，我还能更调皮，看着吧，我会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>呃……咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-610601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-610601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-610601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">屠夫：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"610110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"610110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-610110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-610110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗莱迪：</div><div>救，救……呃……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "GLN-00"}}